      "content": "accepting it? how? it just feels like i'm just waiting for my life to end anyway. like i'm just a leftover. there's no \"new version\" of me that matters. it just feels like more effort to exist just to be nothing. why bother trying to find a new way when the only thing i've actually achieved is being completely empty?",
